<title>USA: Ensec to offer more shares in IPO - Rickel.</title>
<headline>Ensec to offer more shares in IPO - Rickel.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ensec International Inc will offer 1.9 million shares in its proposed initial public offering, up from its initial estimate of 1.7 million shares, according to underwriter Rickel &amp; Associates.</p>
<p>The company is tentatively scheduled to go public next week. The common stock is being offered at $6.25, according to a regulatory filing. Ensec will also offer 1.9 million warrants.</p>
<p>Ensec designs, installs and monitors security systems for large commercial or governmental facilities.</p>
